    "collapsible_info_Wn6G8E": {
      "type": "collapsible-info",
      "custom_css": [
        "p {color: #001e37;}",
        "h2 {font-size: 22px;}"
      ],
      "name": "Collapsible Info",
      "settings": {
        "title": "More Information about acne-prone skincare",
        "desc1": "<p>Acne-prone skin thrives on simplicity and balance. Overly aggressive treatments can compromise comfort and barrier function, often contributing to ongoing congestion or sensitivity. This collection of<strong>acne-prone skin care</strong>focuses on gentle purification and targeted correction, helping maintain clear pores while supporting long-term skin tolerance.</p>",
        "desc2": "<p><a href=\"https://www.ellabache.com.au/collections/cleansers\">Cleansing</a> is the first step in clearing impurities and excess sebum without stripping the skin, while regular <a href=\"https://www.ellabache.com.au/collections/exfoliants\">exfoliation</a> encourages renewal and discourages pore congestion. Targeted <strong>skin serums for acne-prone skin</strong> help address visible concerns, and <a href=\"https://www.ellabache.com.au/collections/moisture-protectives\">protective <strong>moisturisers</strong></a> restore lost hydration.</p><p>Explore our dedicated <strong>acne-prone skin care products</strong> below.</p><h2>Acne-Prone Skin Care Products To Help Control Breakouts</h2><p>Managing acne-prone skin requires consistent cleansing and balancing without compromising the barrier function. This collection brings together targeted cleansing, renewal and active treatments designed keep breakouts under control without drying out or irritating the skin.</p><h3>Foaming Cleansers</h3><p>Excess sebum, impurities and environmental residue all contribute to congestion and breakouts. A foaming cleanser formulated with plant-based micro proteins can gently dissolve residue while still respecting the skin’s natural protective film.</p><h3>Multi-Acid Regenerative Peels</h3><p>Congestion can occur at multiple levels of the skin’s surface. Using a multi-acid regenerative peel helps target these different levels with a blend of fruit acids and exfoliation active acids to deeply purify, regenerate, and exfoliate for brighter skin that looks and feels refreshed.</p><h3>Breakout Treatment Creams</h3><p>Targeted treatment creams are designed to address visible blemishes by helping regulate excess oil and purify the skin’s surface. Ingredients such as zinc oxide and botanical extracts support healing and clarity while maintaining moisture balance to reduce the risk of over-drying.</p><h3>Intensive Balancing Lotions</h3><p>Breakouts can be red, angry and uncomfortable. An intensive balancing lotion with ingredients like witch hazel, rosemary, marshmallow extract, and aloe vera helps both absorb oil and promote healing, as well as soothe and reduce irritation and discomfort</p><h3>Treatment Masque For Oily Skin</h3><p>Oil buildup is a common cause of acne. Regularly using a targeted treatment masque for oily skin, like the Radiance Charcoal Mask, helps absorb oil and purify the skin, while promoting radiance and clarity back into the skin .</p>",
        "expand_ctn_txt": "Read more",
        "padding_top": 36,
        "padding_bottom": 36
      }
    },
